title: APC NetBotz: Motion sensors
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/environment
license: GPLv2
distribution: kuhn-ruess
description:
 This check monitors motion sensors of APC NetBotz cameras via SNMP
 (NetBotz50-MIB, motionSensorTable).

 The service is {OK} if no motion is detected. Detected motion is {OK} by
 default, the state can be set with the rule "APC NetBotz motion sensors".
 An undefined value is {UNKNOWN}. An error status of the sensor adds
 {WARN} (warning) or {CRIT} (error, critical, failure).

item:
 The sensor id as reported by the device.

discovery:
 One service is created for each motion sensor.
